flowchart TD
  User[User submits contextual feedback] --> BA[BA reproduces and triages]
  BA --> Clarify[Reporter clarifies]
  Clarify --> BA
  BA --> Delta[Business owner accepts requirement delta]
  BA --> Deferred[Reasoned defer or reject]
  Delta --> Backlog[Linked issue and acceptance criteria]
  Backlog --> Release[Reviewed implementation and release]
  Release --> Validate[Reporter validates release]
  Validate -->|Pass| Closed[Closure evidence]
  Validate -->|Fail| BA
